#: title/pc5_ui.c:7015
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 esegue i tuoi giochi per PC con prospero-win: Wine, DXVK per Direct3D "
"da 8 a 11, VKD3D-Proton per Direct3D 12 e Mesa (RADV per Vulkan, Zink per "
"OpenGL)."

